{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "b1e7d448b62b40c88c27e474619c0f44",
    "m_Title": "SG_DissolveEmissiveLit",
    "m_Content": "HDRP Lit, opaque + alpha clip.\n1) Triplanar grime: object-space triplanar noise (R) darkens albedo; stays glued to moving props.\n2) Dissolve/Reveal: noise (G) vs _DissolveAmount. Emission mask is revealed behind a glowing burn front. _DissolveClip = 1 also clips geometry.\n3) Emission: mask * color * intensity (nits) * pulse, + burn front, + _HitFlash driven from C# (MaterialPropertyBlock).",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -2200.0,
        "y": -1000.0,
        "width": 520.0,
